{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1573658,\"title\":\"Behind the Behind the Scenes\",\"tagline\":\"You filming? Good. Always roll. Movies Move. Cinema never stops.\",\"overview\":\"Behind the Behind the Scenes is a mockumentary comedy that dives into the beautiful chaos of student filmmaking. It follows The Director, a self-proclaimed visionary convinced his short film will redefine cinema.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4jj9u3zWG7a9QSitrTj8kwMSjEb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/haxSYSBxJHxJHElK0kOQPMotXgP.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2025,\"runtime\":47,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"KE\",\"name\":\"Kenya\"}],\"budget\":100,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"James Ongige\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":3740043,\"name\":\"James Ongige\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/87cpqlwrkX3PsrAcWzoOwD9jRok.jpg\"},{\"id\":3740043,\"name\":\"James Ongige\",\"character\":\"The Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/87cpqlwrkX3PsrAcWzoOwD9jRok.jpg\"},{\"id\":5614251,\"name\":\"Silvia Masaa\",\"character\":\"Sound Person\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5792154,\"name\":\"Michelle Wanjiru\",\"character\":\"The Actor\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5792172,\"name\":\"Brian samuel\",\"character\":\"Crew Member\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6063160,\"name\":\"Alvina Achieng\",\"character\":\"Crew Member\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6063161,\"name\":\"Vanessa Muhati\",\"character\":\"Camera Person\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":120467,\"title\":\"The Grand Budapest Hotel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eWdyYQreja6JGCzqHWXpWHDrrPo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jK65srQczOKTpW62wPxwwKztGgE.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Grand Budapest Hotel tells of a legendary concierge at a famous European hotel between the wars and his friendship with a young employee who becomes his trusted protégé. The story involves the theft and recovery of a priceless Renaissance painting, the battle for an enormous family fortune and the slow and then sudden upheavals that transformed Europe during the first half of the 20th century.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":18240,\"title\":\"The Proposal\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6stnAm1wSek8ZrislwK4xGTyCnt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ojgXOhVi9Yk8irDpRfDkIzdD1LK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When she learns she's in danger of losing her visa status and being deported, overbearing book editor Margaret Tate forces her put-upon assistant, Andrew Paxton, to marry her.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20453,\"title\":\"3 Idiots\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/66A9MqXOyVFCssoloscw79z8Tew.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u7kuUaySqXBVAtqEl9vkTkAzHV9.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Rascal. Joker. Dreamer. Genius... You've never met a college student quite like \\\"Rancho.\\\" From the moment he arrives at India's most prestigious university, Rancho's outlandish schemes turn the campus upside down—along with the lives of his two newfound best friends. Together, they make life miserable for \\\"Virus,\\\" the school’s uptight and heartless dean. But when Rancho catches the eye of the dean's daughter, Virus sets his sights on flunking out the \\\"3 idiots\\\" once and for all.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10147,\"title\":\"Bad Santa\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rfClLIyeHqpMofmrPY8DaLe4z9x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tbmNzJIc7R1MuEweCOThpTzglyx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"You'd better watch out - Willie T. Soke is coming to town, and he d